cription":"Sales coaching that really makes a difference. Experience, empathy, and real practice meet modern learning methods."},"salesai":{"tagline":"AI for Sales","description":"We show which AI tools really make sense for sales and how you can make your sales smarter."},"cta":"Discover All Brands"},"cta":{"title":"Ready for the next","titleHighlight":"Level?","subtitle":"Let's find out together how we can transform your sales.","primary":"Contact Us Now","secondary":"Send Email","benefits":"Free Initial Consultation • No Obligations • Individual Solutions"},"footer":{"description":"We are your partner for successful sales. With over 15 years of experience and four strong brands, we move your business forward.","quickLinks":"Quick Links","ourBrands":"Our Brands","contact":"Contact","email":"Email","phone":"Phone","address":"Address","legal":"Legal","followUs":"Follow Us","copyright":"All rights reserved."},"contact":{"title":"Contact","subtitle":"Let's work together on your sales success","email":"Email","phone":"Phone","address":"Address","tabs":{"writeMessage":"Write a message","requestCallback":"Request callback","otherInquiries":"Other Inquiry","writeMessageShort":"Message","requestCallbackShort":"Callback","otherInquiriesShort":"Inquiry"},"form":{"company":"Your Company Name","firstName":"First Name","lastName":"Last Name","email":"Email","phone":"Phone","message":"Message","submit":"Submit","callbackRequest":"Request Callback","phonePlaceholder":"+1 234 567890","desiredTime":"When can we reach you?","notes":"Notes (optional)","notesPlaceholder":"What is the call about?","callbackEmailNote":"For confirmation of your callback","callbackTimeNote":"We will call you at the requested time","privacyPrefix":"By submitting the form, you agree that","privacySuffix":"uses your provided data for the purpose of processing your request. Your data will only be stored to answer your request and will not be passed on to third parties.","privacySuffixCallback":"uses your provided data for the purpose of the callback arrangement.","privacyLink":"More information can be found in our privacy policy.","privacyNoteLabel":"PRIVACY NOTICE:"},"sidebar":{"title":"Why","description1":"Whether you are looking for support in active sales, strategic consulting, or the selection of modern AI solutions – we help you!","descriptionMessage":"Contact us for a non-binding consultation and let's work on your sales success together.","descriptionCallback":"Schedule a callback and we will discuss together how we can move your sales forward.","descriptionOther":"Use this form for general inquiries, questions about your rights, or other matters.","closingMessage":"We look forward to your inquiry!","closingCallback":"We look forward to your call!","closingOther":"We will respond to your inquiry as quickly as possible!"},"messages":{"writeUs":"Write to us","writeUsDesc":"Send us a message and we will get back to you within 24 hours","callback":"Schedule a callback","callbackDesc":"Let us know when we can best reach you","otherInquiry":"Other Inquiry","otherInquiryDesc":"Have questions or general inquiries? We're happy to help!","successTitle":"Sent!","successDesc":"We will get back to you within 24 hours.","callSuccessTitle":"Callback requested!","callSuccessDesc":"We will call you at the requested time.","errorTitle":"Something went wrong","errorDesc":"Please check your entries"},"submissionBanner":{"title":"Forms temporarily unavailable","defaultMessage":"Contact forms are not being processed at this time.","notifyCta":"Get notified when forms go live","dismiss":"Dismiss notice"},"notify":{"close":"Close","cancel":"Cancel","emailLabel":"Email address","emailPlaceholder":"you@example.com","switchToRemove":"Remove email from list","switchToSubscribe":"← Back to notifications","tabs":{"subscribe":"Subscribe","remove":"Unsubscribe"},"errors":{"generic":"Something went wrong. Please try again.","network":"Network error. Please check your connection and try again.","invalidEmail":"Enter a valid email address."},"subscribe":{"title":"Stay in the loop","description":"Enter your email and we'll notify you as soon as our contact forms are back online.","cta":"Notify me","loading":"Saving…"},"remove":{"title":"Remove your email","description":"Enter the email address you'd like to remove from our notification list.","cta":"Remove","loading":"Removing…"},"success":{"title":"You're on the list!","description":"We'll send you a notification as soon as the contact forms go live."},"duplicate":{"title":"You're already on the list!","description":"We already have your email. We'll reach out as soon as forms are live."},"removed":{"title":"Email removed","description":"Your email has been removed from our notification list. You won't receive any further updates."}},"otherForm":{"topic":"Topic","selectTopic":"Please select a topic","topics":{"withdrawal":"Right of Withdrawal","question":"Question","legal":"Legal"},"subject":"Subject","subjectPlaceholder":"Enter a specific subject","optional":"optional"},"accountHelper":{"badge":"Signed-in shortcut","title":"Use your current account details","description":"If you are reaching out from your own Clerk account, we can prefill your name and email so sending a contact request is faster.","signedInAs":"Signed in as {email}","emailNote":"You can still replace the form email with a company address if that is the best address for follow-up. We will store both for clarity.","useAccount":"Use my account details","useAccountSuccess":"Added to the form","signedOutTitle":"Want faster contact forms?","signedOutDescription":"Sign in first and we can prefill your contact details automatically and keep your submitted inquiries together in your account.","signInCta":"Sign in to prefill","storedAccountNote":"When you submit while signed in, we store both your logged-in account and the contact email you entered so follow-up stays clear.","successNotice":"Your signed-in details are now in the form below.","scrollNotice":"Your signed-in details were added below."}},"about":{"hero":{"badge":"About Us","titlePart1":"Your Home for","titlePart2":"Excellent Sales","subtitle":"The <brand>Advantis Group GmbH</brand> unites over 15 years of sales experience under one roof – with passion, pragmatism, and a clear focus on success."},"mission":{"badge":"Mission","title":"Sales as a Craft and Attitude","description":"We understand sales not as a coincidence, but as a craft. Our claim: sustainable, effective, and practical solutions that work."},"vision":{"badge":"Vision","title":"Familiar, Professional, Honest","description":"We are familiar in our interactions, professional in implementation, and honest in results – for long-term partnerships that create trust."},"story":{"badge":"Our Story","text1":"The <brand>Advantis Group GmbH</brand> was founded in 2025 by <founder>Andrea Reichl</founder> and unites over 15 years of sales experience in various industries under one roof.","text2":"What began years ago as a sole proprietorship is now a group of companies with strong brands and a common focus: 100% Sales.","text3":"We don't do frills – we haven't reinvented the wheel, just put on some fancy rims. Pragmatic, effective, sustainable."},"stats":{"experience":"Years Experience","projects":"Successful Projects","brands":"Strong Brands"},"values":{"badge":"Our Values","experienceTitle":"Experience","experienceDesc":"Over 15 years of sales experience in various industries","innovationTitle":"Innovation","innovationDesc":"Modern tools and proven methods for maximum efficiency","passionTitle":"Passion","passionDesc":"Sustainable results through commitment and expertise"},"cta":{"title":"Ready for the Next Step?","description":"Let us work together on your sales success. Whether support in active sales, strategic consulting, or modern AI solutions – we help you.","button":"Contact Us"}},"team":{"hero":{"badge":"The Team","titlePart1":"The Faces Behind","subtitle":"Experts, visionaries, and doers. United by the passion for excellent sales."},"founder":{"role":"CEO / Managing Director","badge":"Leadership","quote":"\"Sales is not just a job, it's an attitude.\"","bio":"Sales enthusiast, strategist, and doer. With over 15 years of experience in sales, coaching, and company building, Andrea leads the Advantis Group with passion, pragmatism, and a clear focus on success and humanity.","contactBtn":"Contact"},"roles":{"inbound":"Team Lead Inbound Sales","outbound":"Team Lead Outbound Sales","it":"IT Project Manager","hr":"HR Specialist","marketing":"Online Marketing Manager","coach":"Coach and Trainer","quality":"Data Protection Officer and Quality Manager"},"grid":{"title":"Our Team","subtitle":"The experts by your side","cardFooter":"Advantis Team"}},"brandsPage":{"hero":{"badge":"Four Premium Brands – One Goal","titlePrefix":"Our","titleSuffix":"Brands","subtitle":"Tailored sales solutions for sustainable success","scroll":"Discover our brands"},"items":{"salespirates":{"tagline":"Your external sales agency","description":"Your external sales agency for inbound or outbound sales. We deliver leads or support your sales - actively, targeted, and with measurable results.","highlights":{"0":"Lead Generation & Qualification","1":"Inbound & Outbound Sales","2":"Measurable Performance"}},"rodeo":{"tagline":"Strategic Sales Consulting","description":"Sales is the Wild West and with Rodeo we know our way around! We deliver strategic sales consulting that realigns your sales, makes it absolutely scalable, and leads to growth with efficiency.","highlights":{"0":"Strategic Realignment","1":"Scalable Processes","2":"Growth-Oriented"}},"oldschool":{"tagline":"Authentic Sales Trainings","description":"The world doesn't need new sales gimmicks. We bring your sales teams to the max with authentic sales coaching! The magic word here is sustainability. You can book 1000 sales coachings without ever being successful in daily business - we have the one training that really moves you and your team forward. Experience, empathy, and real practice meet modern learning methods.","highlights":{"0":"Sustainable Trainings","1":"Practice-Oriented","2":"Modern Learning Methods"}},"salesai":{"tagline":"AI for Intelligent Sales","description":"Everyone is talking about AI tools. We advise you on which AI tools currently make sense for sales teams and bring real added value. We show you how AI technology actually makes your sales smarter.","highlights":{"0":"AI Tool Consulting","1":"Practical Integration","2":"Real Added Value"}}},"cta":{"titlePart1":"Which brand","titlePart2":"suits you?","description":"Let's find out together how we can take your sales to the next level.","button":"Contact Now"},"learnMore":"Learn More"},"privacy":{"title":"Privacy Policy","subtitle":"Information on the processing of your data in accordance with GDPR","tableOfContents":"Table of Contents","sections":{"overview":{"title":"Privacy at a Glance","content":"The following information provides a simple overview of what happens to your personal data when you visit this website. Personal data is any data that can be used to personally identify you."},"general":{"title":"General Information","content1":"The operators of these pages take the protection of your personal data very seriously. We treat your personal data confidentially and in accordance with the legal data protection regulations as well as this privacy policy.","content2":"When you use this website, various personal data is collected. This privacy policy explains what data we collect and what we use it for."},"responsible":{"title":"Responsible Party","intro":"The party responsible for data processing on this website is:"},"collection":{"title":"Data Collection","subtitle":"What data do we collect?","intro":"When visiting this website, the server automatically stores information that your browser transmits. This includes:","items":{"ip":"IP address","browser":"Browser type and version","os":"Operating system used","datetime":"Date and time of access","referrer":"Websites from which the user's system accessed our website"},"footer":"This data is used exclusively to ensure the operation and to improve the service. It is not merged with other data sources."},"contact":{"title":"Contact Form","content1":"If you send us inquiries via email or contact form, your information from the inquiry form including the contact data you provided will be stored for the purpose of processing the inquiry and in case of follow-up questions.","content2":"We do not share this data without your consent. Processing is based on Art. 6 para. 1 lit. b GDPR, if your inquiry is related to the fulfillment of a contract or is necessary for the implementation of pre-contractual measures."},"rights":{"title":"Your Rights","intro":"You have the right at any time to free information about your stored personal data, its origin and recipients, and the purpose of data processing, as well as the right to correct or delete this data.","subtitle":"Your rights at a glance:","items":{"access":{"title":"Right of access:","description":"You can request information about your stored data"},"rectification":{"title":"Right to rectification:","description":"You can request the correction of inaccurate data"},"deletion":{"title":"Right to deletion:","description":"You can request the deletion of your data"},"restriction":{"title":"Right to restriction of processing:","description":"You can request the restriction of processing"},"objection":{"title":"Right to object:","description":"You can object to the processing"},"portability":{"title":"Right to data portability:","description":"You can receive your data in a structured format"}},"footer":"For this and other questions on the subject of personal data, you can always contact us at the address given in the imprint."}}},"imprint":{"title":"Imprint","sections":{"company":{"title":"Information according to § 5 TMG","country":"Germany"},"contact":{"title":"Contact","email":"Ema